0f2ce9628.mp4?t=1793959738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide how much you’re willing to risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vaultbreakers lets you freely move between <strong>PvE and PvPvE</strong> modes with shared progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE offers a safer path to growth, while PvPvE raises the stakes, adding other players to the equation and dramatically increasing rewards and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go solo or <strong>team up with up to two friends</strong> to tackle missions together, facing AI enemies, rival players, or both at once. Trust your teammates, coordinate your actions, and decide together when to push deeper or when to escape before it’s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/99d2e2dfcede397c60a59acc1a75c679.poster.avif?t=1793959738\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/99d2e2dfcede397c60a59acc1a75c679.webm?t=1793959738\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/306910/extras/99d2e2dfcede397c60a59acc1a75c679.mp4?t=1793959738\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two missions play out the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They evolve dynamically based on the actions of <strong>other players and NPCs</strong>. One group might pollute a massive area with dark magic, another could unlock a hidden cave, while someone else begins an ancient ritual that changes the entire map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice creates new threats and new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert and use the environment to your advantage. Launch ambushes with exploding Cacti, lure enemies into traps, harness thunderous hazards, or make a narrow escape when plans fall apart. The world is alive, unpredictable, and always watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vaultbreakers, survival isn’t just about strength. It’s about knowing when to fight, when to flee, and when to risk everything for greater rewards and power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "short_description": "Vaultbreakers is a top-down Extraction RPG where you go on PvE or PvPvE adventures. Build your haven, loot ancient artifacts that shape your playstyle, and explore a vast, corrupted world, alone or with friends. Use preparation, knowledge, and skills to clear your path to the Dragonvault.",
